`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"2072d7fb670764dad065ad39ff8e12cb","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"fab79196031abe5bc8de2788ef5c66d2","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"c516091b58f8288ec76cd1541aa9a4ec","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"beee09891bd3f91cd4afa29b5892ba3a","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"cad1d83c585339e272cb38ccd6cdb8f4","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"f43bc3ca9e2d89ca7dd1b0b433d2c8fb","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"b718dcd67865d2c601d428bf87edf29b","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"a1d4f3ea797c29f30920b6619155b4e9","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"f6680f8f482cc598b894dcf54d6e6629","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[True]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1795012338862,"stop":1795012338965,"duration":103,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":"